OL,3,GNEWSAFriends rally around five-year-old
OL,4,Aboy with cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis mother, Mary, said his symptoms
OL,7,Fwere first thought to be a hip
OL,8,Fcondition or a virus, but after his
OL,9,Fcondition worsened, Emilio was admitted
OL,10,Fto hospital in Kent, where scans found
OL,11,Fa mass. She said: "Our entire world has
OL,12,Fchanged in just a few weeks."
OL,14,FA fundraising campaign to help the
OL,15,Ffamily has already raised more than
OL,16,F#4,700 towards a #7,000 target.
